# Tasks: Last.fm Scrobble CLI with Incremental Sync

**Input**: Design documents from `/specs/001-lastfm-scrobble-cli/`  
**Prerequisites**: `plan.md` (required), `spec.md` (required for user stories)  
**Tests**: All test tasks included; TDD mandatory per constitution  
**Organization**: Tasks grouped by user story for independent implementation and testing

## Format: `[ID] [P?] [Story] Description`

- **[ID]**: Unique task identifier (T001, T002, etc.)
- **[P]**: Task can run in parallel with others (different packages, no dependencies)
- **[Story]**: User story identifier (US1, US2, US3, US4, US5)
- **File paths**: Relative to repository root; Go package structure per `plan.md`

---

## Phase 1: Setup & Project Initialization

**Purpose**: Initialize Go project, dependencies, and build infrastructure

- [ ] T001 [P] Create Go module `github.com/user/lastfm-reader` in repository root
- [ ] T002 [P] Initialize `go.mod` and `go.sum` with primary dependencies (cobra, viper, zap, Azure SDK, backoff, rate)
- [ ] T003 [P] Create directory structure per plan: `cmd/lastfm-sync/`, `internal/{config,lastfm,watermark,writer,ratelimit,logging,version}/`, `pkg/testutil/`
- [ ] T004 [P] Create `Makefile` with targets: `deps`, `lint`, `test`, `test-coverage`, `build`, `build-all`, `docker`, `release`
- [ ] T005 [P] Create `.golangci.yml` with strict linting rules (gocyclo < 10, errcheck, ineffassign, misspell)
- [ ] T006 [P] Create `Dockerfile` (multi-stage: build + distroless nonroot runtime)
- [ ] T007 [P] Create `.github/workflows/test.yml` (lint, test with Azurite service, coverage upload)
- [ ] T008 [P] Create `.github/workflows/release.yml` (cross-compile, docker build/push, GitHub release)
- [ ] T009 [P] Create `go.mod` build info injection setup for version, timestamp (in `cmd/lastfm-sync/main.go`)
- [ ] T010 [P] Create `README.md` template with usage, installation, examples (to be filled during polish)
- [ ] T011 [P] Create `LICENSE` (Apache-2.0) and `NOTICE` files

